# Vyllion Capital Markets Platform - Environment Configuration

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Email Intake Service (Web3Forms / Formspree)
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# To receive demo requests directly in your inbox:
# 1. Visit https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter your destination email address (e.g. your email or vyllion@novek.et)
# 3. Paste the Access Key received below:
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here

# Optional: If you prefer Formspree instead, provide your form ID (from https://formspree.io):
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=your_formspree_id_here
